  "Reference": "Beissbarth T, Hyde L, Smyth GK, Job C, Boon WM, Tan SS,\nScott HS, Speed TP: Statistical modeling of sequencing errors\nin SAGE libraries, Bioinformatics, 2004 20(Suppl. 1):i31-9.",
